---
import { consumptionDimensions } from '../../data/consumptionEvolution';
---

<div class="six-dimensions flex flex-col gap-px rounded-sm overflow-hidden border border-brass-mid/20">
  {consumptionDimensions.map((d) => (
    <div class="dim-row bg-ink-elevated/40 p-5 grid grid-cols-[3rem_1fr] gap-4 items-start">
      <div class="text-2xl text-coral-deep font-light leading-none pt-0.5 font-serif-en">{d.num}</div>
      <div>
        <h4 class="font-medium text-cream mb-3 tracking-cn">{d.title}</h4>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
          <div>
            <p class="text-xs text-brass-mid uppercase tracking-widest mb-1">第六代消费</p>
            <p class="text-sm text-text-soft leading-relaxed">{d.gen6}</p>
          </div>
          <div class="md:border-l-2 md:border-coral-deep/50 md:pl-4">
            <p class="text-xs text-coral-deep uppercase tracking-widest mb-1">山海造物</p>
            <p class="text-sm text-cream leading-relaxed">{d.shanhai}</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  ))}
</div>

<div class="mt-6 p-5 bg-ink-deep/50 rounded-sm border-l-2 border-coral-deep">
  <p class="text-xs text-coral-mid uppercase tracking-widest mb-2">Six dimensions · one position</p>
  <p class="text-coral-deep font-medium leading-relaxed mb-1">
    六个维度合起来 · 就是山海造物在第六代消费中的精准位置：
  </p>
  <p class="text-cream/90 text-sm leading-relaxed">
    不靠流量 · 不靠折扣 · 不靠营销轰炸——<br />
    <span class="font-medium text-cream">靠的是：让算法疲劳的人 · 找到一个值得停下来的物。</span>
  </p>
</div>
